el/status/2117654528845857212?s=46</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/wednesday-assorted-links-578.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=wednesday-assorted-links-578">Wednesday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/christianvedel/status/2117654528845857212?s=46</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/christianvedel/status/2117654528845857212?s=46</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 16:48:24 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Recent-graduate unemployment fell to 5.2%, its lowest level this year.]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWNkFYFWcAARds4?format=webp&name=large"></p><p>Revana Sharfuddin (@R_Sharfuddin_) on X</p><p>🚨 Just out: Recent-graduate unemployment fell to 5.2%, its lowest level this year.</p><p>URL: <a href="https://x.com/R_Sharfuddin_/status/2117646477904294299">https://x.com/R_Sharfuddin_/status/2117646477904294299</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/wednesday-assorted-links-578.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=wednesday-assorted-links-578">Wednesday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://x.com/R_Sharfuddin_/status/2117646477904294299</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://x.com/R_Sharfuddin_/status/2117646477904294299</guid><pubDate>Wed, 04 Nov 2026 16:48:24 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title><![CDATA[Martian dust is a problem]]></title><description><![CDATA[<p>URL: <a href="https://www.pnas.org/doi/10.1073/pnas.2620747123">https://www.pnas.org/doi/10.1073/pnas.2620747123</a></p><p>source: <a href="https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/wednesday-assorted-links-578.html?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=wednesday-assorted-links-578">Wednesday assorted links</a></p>]]></description><link>https://www.pnas.org/doi/10.1073/pnas.2620747123</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.pnas.org/doi/10.1073/pnas.2620747123</guid><pub